  "slug": "kokla-motion-state-s2s001",
  "status": "publish",
  "type": "product",
  "link": "https://yoyaku.io/release/kokla-motion-state-s2s001/",
  "title": {
   "rendered": "Motion State"
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>S2S001 marks the debut release on Side2Side, introducing both the label and its founder, Kokla. A DJ, producer, and dedicated record collector, Kokla channels years of digging and dancefloor experience into music designed with selectors firmly in mind. Across four groove-led cuts, house, techno, and acid converge through rolling rhythms, subtle progression, and finely crafted textures. Built for long nights and longer sets, the record favours timeless functionality over fleeting trends.<br />\nFounded in Cairo and shaped by a global perspective, Side2Side is a home for carefully curated electronic music rooted in movement, connection, and vinyl culture. Every release is conceived as a document of its time, crafted for selectors, dancers, and those who believe the smallest details leave the deepest impression.<br />\nMusic without borders. Movement without hierarchy. This is Side2Side.</p>\n",
   "protected": false
  },
